Package: retroscrappy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-requests, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets
Recommends: qt6-wayland
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/RetroboxProject/retroscrappy
Description: metadata and artwork scraper for EmulationStation
 Retroscrappy fills the gamelist.xml files of EmulationStation, as used by
 Batocera, RetroBat and Retrobox, with descriptions, box art, logos,
 screenshots and videos from ScreenScraper, SteamGridDB and IGDB.
 .
 It provides a Qt graphical interface (retroscrappy-gui) and a command
 line tool (retroscrappy).
